  ($q$t12$q$, $q$travel$q$, 11, $q$Where is it? In the room, at the station$q$, $j$[{"id":"rule-155","type":"rule","title":"Where something is","body":"Thing + อยู่ (yùu, \"is at\") + ที่ or ใน + place: กุญแจอยู่ในห้อง — \"the key is in the room\", ป้ายรถเมล์อยู่ที่สี่แยก — \"the bus stop is at the intersection\". Leave the thing out and it means you: อยู่ที่สนามบิน — \"(I'm) at the airport\".","source":"Requested by the app owner (2026-11-26)"},{"id":"so-246","type":"sentenceOrder","prompt":"The key is in the room.","tileUnit":"word","words":{"a":{"roman":"gun-jɛɛ","thai":"กุญแจ"},"b":{"roman":"yùu","thai":"อยู่"},"c":{"roman":"nai","thai":"ใน"},"d":{"roman":"hɔ̂ng","thai":"ห้อง"},"x0":{"thai":"สอง","roman":"sɔ̌ɔng"},"x1":{"thai":"ผ้าเช็ดตัว","roman":"phâa-chét-tua"}},"poolOrder":["x1","x0","b","d","c","a"],"correctOrder":["a","b","c","d"],"source":"Requested by the app owner (2026-11-26)"},{"id":"mc-247","type":"translationChoice","thai":"อยู่ที่สนามบิน","roman":"yùu thîi sà-nǎam-bin","options":[{"text":"The key is in the room.","correct":false},{"text":"Where's the toilet?","correct":false},{"text":"Does this room have a bathroom?","correct":false},{"text":"(I'm) at the airport.","correct":true}],"source":"Requested by the app owner (2026-11-26)","parts":["อยู่","ที่","สนามบิน"]},{"id":"so-249","type":"sentenceOrder","prompt":"(I'm) at the train station.","tileUnit":"word","words":{"a":{"roman":"yùu","thai":"อยู่"},"b":{"roman":"thîi","thai":"ที่"},"c":{"roman":"sà-thǎa-nee","thai":"สถานี"},"d":{"roman":"rót-fai","thai":"รถไฟ"},"x0":{"thai":"ด้วย","roman":"dûai"},"x1":{"thai":"ใบ","roman":"bai"}},"poolOrder":["x0","b","d","c","x1","a"],"correctOrder":["a","b","c","d"],"source":"Requested by the app owner (2026-11-26)"},{"id":"sp-250","type":"speak","thai":"ป้ายรถเมล์อยู่ที่สี่แยก","roman":"pâai rót-mee yùu thîi sìi-yɛ̂ɛk","meaning":"The bus stop is at the intersection.","source":"Requested by the app owner (2026-11-26)","parts":["ป้าย","รถเมล์","อยู่","ที่","สี่แ