  ($q$t-dlg$q$, $q$travel$q$, 13, $q$Finding a room in town$q$, $j${"kind":"dialogue","scene":"Checking into a hotel in Phuket, then asking the way to the market","lines":[{"speaker":"A","thai":"มีห้องมั้ยคะ","roman":"mii hɔ̂ng mái khá","english":"Do you have a room?"},{"speaker":"B","thai":"มีครับ ห้องนี้ได้มั้ยครับ","roman":"mii khráp, hɔ̂ng níi dâi mái khráp","english":"Yes — is this room OK?"},{"speaker":"A","thai":"ได้ค่ะ ขอกุญแจด้วยค่ะ","roman":"dâi khâ, khɔ̌ɔ gun-jɛɛ dûai khâ","english":"Yes. May I have the key, please?"},{"speaker":"A","thai":"ตลาดอยู่ที่ไหนคะ","roman":"tà-làat yùu thîi-nǎi khá","english":"Where's the market?"},{"speaker":"B","thai":"เลี้ยวขวาที่สี่แยกครับ ไม่ไกล","roman":"líao khwǎa thîi sìi-yɛ̂ɛk khráp, mâi glai","english":"Turn right at the intersection — not far."}],"steps":[{"type":"intro"},{"type":"comprehension","lineIndex":0,"options":[{"text":"Do you have a room?","correct":true},{"text":"Where's the market?","correct":false},{"text":"May I have the key, please?","correct":false},{"text":"Not far.","correct":false}]},{"type":"comprehension","lineIndex":3,"options":[{"text":"Where's the market?","correct":true},{"text":"Where's the bank?","correct":false},{"text":"Do you have a room?","correct":false},{"text":"Turn left.","correct":false}]},{"type":"translate","lineIndex":1,"options":[{"text":"Yes — is this room OK?","correct":true},{"text":"Do you have a room?","correct":false},{"text":"Where's this room?","correct":false},{"text":"We don't have any rooms.","correct":false}]},{"type":"translate","lineIndex":4,"options":[{"text":"Turn right at the intersection — not far.","correct":true},{"text":"Turn left at the intersection.","correct":false},{"text":"Where's the market?","correct":false},{"text":"Go straight along this street.","correct":false}]},{"type":"blank","lineIndex":2,"before":"dâi khâ, khɔ̌ɔ","after":"dûai khâ","options":[{"text":"gun-jɛɛ","correct":true},{"text":"hɔ̂ng","correct":false},{"text":"phâa-chét-tua","correct":